# 必考词 Unit19
# 领域: 考研
# 学科: 英语词汇
# 来源: 2023红宝书考研英语词汇-必考词
# 描述: 必考词Unit19核心高频词汇

{{relieve}}{/rɪˈliːv/}}{v. 缓解；减轻}}{{The medicine helped relieve the pain in her back.}}

{{reluctant}}{/rɪˈlʌktənt/}}{adj. 不情愿的；勉强的}}{{He was reluctant to admit his mistake.}}

{{rely}}{/rɪˈlaɪ/}}{v. 依赖；信任}}{{Many people rely on public transportation to get to work.}}

{{remain}}{/rɪˈmeɪn/}}{v. 保持；剩余}}{{The temperature will remain high throughout the week.}}

{{remark}}{/rɪˈmɑːrk/}}{n. 评论；v. 说}}{{She made a remark about the quality of the food.}}

{{remarkable}}{/rɪˈmɑːrkəbl/}}{adj. 显著的；非凡的}}{{The athlete made a remarkable recovery from his injury.}}

{{remedy}}{/ˈremədi/}}{n. 补救办法；v. 补救}}{{There is no easy remedy for the problem of pollution.}}

{{remote}}{/rɪˈməʊt/}}{adj. 遥远的；偏僻的}}{{The village is located in a remote area of the mountains.}}

{{render}}{/ˈrendər/}}{v. 使成为；提供；呈递}}{{The accident rendered him unable to walk for months.}}

{{renew}}{/rɪˈnjuː/}}{v. 更新；续期}}{{She renewed her passport before it expired.}}

{{reputation}}{/ˌrepjuˈteɪʃn/}}{n. 名誉；声望}}{{The company has built a strong reputation for quality.}}

{{request}}{/rɪˈkwest/}}{n./v. 请求；要求}}{{He submitted a request for a day off.}}

{{require}}{/rɪˈkwaɪər/}}{v. 需要；要求}}{{The job requires strong communication skills.}}

{{research}}{/rɪˈsɜːrtʃ/}}{n./v. 研究；调查}}{{The research was published in a scientific journal.}}

{{resemble}}{/rɪˈzembl/}}{v. 相似；像}}{{The building resembles a ship from a distance.}}

{{resent}}{/rɪˈzent/}}{v. 怨恨；愤慨}}{{She resented being treated unfairly by her boss.}}

{{reserve}}{/rɪˈzɜːrv/}}{v. 保留；预约；n. 储备}}{{Please reserve a table for two at the restaurant.}}

{{reside}}{/rɪˈzaɪd/}}{v. 居住；存在于}}{{The power of decision resides with the board of directors.}}

{{resign}}{/rɪˈzaɪn/}}{v. 辞职；顺从}}{{He resigned from his position due to health reasons.}}

{{resist}}{/rɪˈzɪst/}}{v. 抵抗；抵制}}{{The material resists heat and corrosion.}}

{{resolve}}{/rɪˈzɒlv/}}{v. 解决；决心}}{{The two parties resolved their dispute through negotiation.}}

{{resource}}{/rɪˈsɔːrs/}}{n. 资源；办法}}{{Water is a precious natural resource that must be protected.}}

{{respond}}{/rɪˈspɒnd/}}{v. 回答；反应}}{{The company responded quickly to customer complaints.}}

{{restore}}{/rɪˈstɔːr/}}{v. 恢复；修复}}{{The old painting was carefully restored by experts.}}

{{restrain}}{/rɪˈstreɪn/}}{v. 克制；限制}}{{He had to restrain his anger during the discussion.}}

{{restrict}}{/rɪˈstrɪkt/}}{v. 限制；约束}}{{Access to the building is restricted to authorized personnel.}}

{{retain}}{/rɪˈteɪn/}}{v. 保留；保持}}{{The company retained its top talent with competitive salaries.}}

{{reveal}}{/rɪˈviːl/}}{v. 揭示；透露}}{{The investigation revealed surprising facts about the case.}}

{{revenue}}{/ˈrevənjuː/}}{n. 收入；税收}}{{The company's annual revenue exceeded $10 billion.}}

{{reverse}}{/rɪˈvɜːrs/}}{v. 颠倒；adj. 相反的}}{{The court reversed the decision of the lower court.}}

{{review}}{/rɪˈvjuː/}}{v./n. 回顾；评论}}{{The committee will review all the applications next week.}}

{{revolution}}{/ˌrevəˈluːʃn/}}{n. 革命；旋转}}{{The industrial revolution transformed the world economy.}}

{{reward}}{/rɪˈwɔːrd/}}{n. 奖赏；v. 报答}}{{Hard work will eventually bring its own reward.}}

{{rid}}{/rɪd/}}{v. 使摆脱；除去}}{{The new medicine helped rid the body of the infection.}}

{{rigid}}{/ˈrɪdʒɪd/}}{adj. 严格的；僵硬的}}{{The company has rigid rules about workplace safety.}}

{{rival}}{/ˈraɪvl/}}{n. 竞争对手；adj. 竞争的}}{{The two companies have been rivals for decades.}}

{{route}}{/ruːt/}}{n. 路线；途径}}{{The fastest route to the airport is via the highway.}}

{{routine}}{/ruːˈtiːn/}}{n. 日常工作；adj. 常规的}}{{Exercise should be part of your daily routine.}}

{{rural}}{/ˈrʊərəl/}}{adj. 农村的；田园的}}{{Rural areas often lack access to quality healthcare.}}

{{sacrifice}}{/ˈsækrɪfaɪs/}}{v./n. 牺牲；献祭}}{{Parents often make sacrifices for their children's education.}}
